              "type": "text",
              "name": "t:names.text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>We comply with the <strong>Australian Consumer Law</strong>.<br/>Nothing in these Terms & Conditions excludes, restricts or modifies any rights or remedies that cannot legally be excluded.<br/>If a product has a <strong>major failure</strong>, the customer may generally choose between a refund or replacement. For a minor failure, we may repair or replace the product within a reasonable time. Depending on the circumstances, other remedies may also apply. <br/>Customers are <strong>not automatically entitled to a refund simply because they have changed their mind</strong>, Choose Carefully, we do not refund for incorrect choice / change of mind.  You can exchange new, unopened items sold and fulfilled by The Games Cube PTY LTD within 14 days of delivery/ Purchase. If we make an exception we will refund your order minus any fees from your original transaction.<br/>Any voluntary change-of-mind policy will be subject to the conditions stated at the time of purchase.<br/><strong>Our change-of-mind policy does not limit or replace Australian Consumer Law rights</strong>.</p>",
